circuit:
* Double-balanced Gilbert-cell downconversion mixer (2.4 GHz RF -> 200 MHz IF)
* Single external bias port: iref (50 uA reference current from VDD).
* Ideal R and C primitives allowed in the DUT (no process/mismatch variation).
* Terminal order: vss iref vdd lop lon rfp rfn ifoutp ifoutn

.subckt gilbert_mixer vss iref vdd lop lon rfp rfn ifoutp ifoutn
+ params:
+ rf_w=60 rf_nf=30 rf_l=0.5
+ sw_w=20 sw_nf=10 sw_l=0.15
+ tail_w=1000 tail_nf=100 tail_l=2 tail_m=2
+ ref_w=200 ref_nf=20 ref_l=2
+ re=0

*---- Bias: 50 uA reference -> diode NMOS, mirrored to RF tail current ----
XMref iref iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={ref_l} w={ref_w} nf={ref_nf}
Ciref iref vss 1p

*---- RF transconductance pair (differential input, single tail) ----
XMtaila nidt iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={tail_l} w={tail_w} nf={tail_nf}
XMtailb nidt iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={tail_l} w={tail_w} nf={tail_nf}
XM1 nd1 rfp s1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={rf_l} w={rf_w} nf={rf_nf}
XM2 nd2 rfn s2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={rf_l} w={rf_w} nf={rf_nf}
RE1 s1 nidt {re}
RE2 s2 nidt {re}

*---- LO switching quad (double-balanced commutator) ----
XM3 ifoutp lop nd1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={sw_l} w={sw_w} nf={sw_nf}
XM4 ifoutn lon nd1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={sw_l} w={sw_w} nf={sw_nf}
XM5 ifoutp lon nd2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={sw_l} w={sw_w} nf={sw_nf}
XM6 ifoutn lop nd2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={sw_l} w={sw_w} nf={sw_nf}

*---- Resistive loads to VDD (ideal; output common mode ~1.1 V) ----
RLP vdd ifoutp 2.8k
RLN vdd ifoutn 2.8k

.ends gilbert_mixer
